<title>JAMAICA: SOCCER-JAMAICA, UNITED STATES DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JAMAICA, UNITED STATES DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON, Jamaica 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jamaica and the United States drew 0-0 in a CONCACAF World Cup soccer qualifying game on Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,246</p>
</text>
